{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astro Prospector is an <strong>incremental bullet hell </strong>about mining cofferoids and fighting SpaceCorp. <strong>Collect</strong> resources, <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship and <strong>become</strong> unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astro Prospector Prologue lays the foundation for the full game, but includes its own levels, upgrades and enemies. The Prologue is <strong>just a small part</strong> of everything Astro Prospector will be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine</strong> asteroids from SpaceCorp's fields and steal their AstroCoffee seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512680/extras/FirstZone.gif?t=1746036068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> and upgrade the skill tree to increase your ship power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512680/extras/English-Station.gif?t=1746036068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Machines will try to stop you. <strong>Dodge</strong> their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512680/extras/LastZone.gif?t=1746036068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prologue Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short and intense experience (~40min playtime).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Achievements, including no-hit and speedrun for the bravest rebels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our server Discord</strong>, so you can play early betas and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cofferoid Acquaintance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/322470fe393ccfbea883ada403c7393232a08fc8.jpg"},{"name":"Cofferoid Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/1b9ac25b5c29ee6e157598941c68ca3a5ac7fea0.jpg"},{"name":"Cofferoid Lover <3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/19ca4f16215fd6be269fabe06b8f5d682be226da.jpg"},{"name":"Yep, you can destroy them too","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/7732c14bd89a6e4704a79b708bcaa8cf8623138a.jpg"},{"name":"SpaceCorp Hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/3cbb694e8ab159293ec2597ccfe08dc40ead97ac.jpg"},{"name":"Space Rebel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/31ccdf1d496ef44afbbe663690d36b2534e4f0d1.jpg"},{"name":"Kachin!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/6b1c09cbc20c909f511166f7f4bab22518cf7d50.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/f20c9ede6863eb604af36dad82bcdeda41242e69.jpg"},{"name":"True Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/df896cee677ee8dabc02ad32c05640b3d044d6ce.jpg"},{"name":"Physical Avoidance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3512680/aaeaf156ef83574bfdc19722e5c2503fb3b9190d.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image