n.gif?t=1746036068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Machines will try to stop you. <strong>Dodge</strong> their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512680/extras/LastZone.gif?t=1746036068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prologue Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short and intense experience (~40min playtime).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Achievements, including no-hit and speedrun for the bravest rebels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our server Discord</strong>, so you can play early betas and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p>","developers":["Incrementalist"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3503440","name":"Astro Prospector"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512680/b72e7b3fb100cdb56b2f41c9bef5a88ac7d0394e/header.jpg?t=1746036068","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127748,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127748/movie480.mp4?t=1745576087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127748/movie_max.mp4?t=1745576087"},"name":"Teaser -- Astro Prospector","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127748/6920e418698469bca897d7f6c45